    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">The book aims to examine the making of the nations in Southeast Asia using both historical and political science approaches. Concepts related to nations such as ethnicity, state, indigenism and citizenship have also been analysed in the Southeast Asian context. Specific examples of nation-building in five major Southeast Asian countries are presented. Problems and prospects of Southeast Asia&apos;s nation-building and citizenship building in the era of globalisation are also discussed.</marc:subfield>
